---
description: Black is the sole Python formatter; Ruff is lint-only
alwaysApply: true
---

# Python formatting

- Format Python with Black only: `make format` or `uv run black asitop/ tests/`.
- Use Ruff only as a linter: `make lint` / `uv run ruff check`. Never run `ruff format`.
- Line length is 100 (`[tool.black]` in pyproject.toml).
